s": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Marble Swoop", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Marble Swoop'a ho\u015f geldiniz \u2014 Meta Quest i\u00e7in \u00f6zel olarak tasarlanm\u0131\u015f, s\u00fcr\u00fckleyici bir VR aksiyon-bulmaca deneyimi!\n\nAntik arenalara ad\u0131m at\u0131n ve yuvarlanan mermer raylar\u0131n\u0131n kontrol\u00fcn\u00fc elinize al\u0131n. G\u00f6reviniz basit ama yo\u011fun: renkli toplar\u0131 e\u015fle\u015ftirin, devasa zincir reaksiyonlar\u0131 ba\u015flat\u0131n ve hareketli mermer treni antik kap\u0131lara ula\u015fmadan durdurun.\n\n\u00d6ne \u00c7\u0131kan \u00d6zellikler:\n- \u0130ki D\u00fcnya, 60+ El Yap\u0131m\u0131 Level: Antik'in g\u00fcne\u015fli arenalar\u0131n\u0131 ve Neon'un parlayan kristal arenalar\u0131n\u0131 fethedin \u2014 stratejik olarak dengelenmi\u015f tasar\u0131mlar, m\u00fckemmel \u015fekilde \u00f6l\u00e7eklenen zorluk e\u011frisi ve s\u00fcrekli g\u00fcncellenen meydan okumalar.\n- \u00c7e\u015fitli G\u00fc\u00e7lendirmeler ve \u00d6zel Silahlar: Slow-Mo, Stop, Rewind, Paint, Guided Aim, y\u0131k\u0131c\u0131 Marbles Bombs ve h\u0131zl\u0131 ate\u015f eden Minigun ile b\u00fcy\u00fck y\u0131k\u0131m\u0131 serbest b\u0131rak\u0131n!\n- Ger\u00e7ek VR Deneyimi: Quest cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in tamamen optimize edildi. Ayakta veya oturarak oynay\u0131n; hassas g\u00f6z seviyesi perspektifi ve ak\u0131c\u0131 fizik.\n- K\u00fcresel Yerelle\u015ftirme: \u0130ngilizce, T\u00fcrk\u00e7e, Frans\u0131zca, \u0130spanyolca, \u0130talyanca ve Almanca dahil birden fazla dilde sorunsuz kullan\u0131m.\n- G\u00fcvenli \u0130lerleme ve K\u00fcnye: Tam bulut/yerel kay\u0131t verisi korumas\u0131 ve ayr\u0131lm\u0131\u015f k\u00fcnye b\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fc.\n\nAntik yollar\u0131 temizleyip en b\u00fcy\u00fck mermer ustas\u0131 olabilir misiniz? Marble Swoop'u \u015fimdi indirin ve reflekslerinizi test edin!", "short_description": "En iyi VR aksiyon-bulmaca deneyimini ya\u015fay\u0131n. Renkleri e\u015fle\u015ftirin, yuvarlanan toplar\u0131 patlat\u0131n, g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc \u00f6zel silahlar kullan\u0131n ve etkileyici bir sanal ger\u00e7eklik ortam\u0131nda zorlu arenalar\u0131 fethedin!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE.png", "id": "2081866609098424", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_2081866615765090_949015110819556091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VDYQjj3RzZMQ7kNvwGgEtZQ&_nc_oc=AdpKrA5XFZ4p6ot0NvJTI2Ng9DK1tx6QD1ScBlf7cHyRbQz0ZLsbvf0GdAAEmxUm3c4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQJ-Ai7GLO62I6zMj7oSFo4YRcN_3AJ4_NkRb1Y-tkQfA&oe=6AF34CD4"}, {"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE.png", "id": "1850325272626143", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1850325279292809_2295178359030808781_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zxvGGfVnRoIQ7kNvwFCuGzD&_nc_oc=AdqrpPy4yZVrqRuLwHf7yBJTp15w8hnmcY_di_K-4TGwUgRLUGPB7j1A0P_mwNgPyhw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS45qslHZzuSd-RjEJrCkixrs47EEKRx0lIBVvguQrVNA&oe=6AF34BDD"}, {"file_name": "AppIcon.png", "id": "1782468070546761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825462_1782468073880094_6805242865374174053_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l8mUdOzdhVIQ7kNvwGcRNrj&_nc_oc=AdpxURAWj7I1urSs5mSK-SFjr8ZXLmI4LRmRETxiVEX6pKP3vLW2KC-LWDZFgMmPSfg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQjp6oEHFt3jsfcxm3hVzy1UPTDJjaE34zSfp-dkGOydg&oe=6AF346BA"}, {"file_name": "marble_swoop_cover_portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "1608267824284878", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827960_1608267827618211_2361794878565451425_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cdp21PbAWtgQ7kNvwH_V-tb&_nc_o